  "article": {
    "hero": {
      "title": "💃 Dance Studio Name Generator",
      "tagline": "Names for a dance studio, dance school or dance company."
    },
    "intro": "The **Dance Studio Name Generator** suggests names for a dance studio, dance school, ballet school or dance company: catchy, cute, funny, classic, modern, Indian classical, your town or your own name.",
    "sections": [],
    "faqs": [
      {
        "question": "How do I check a dance studio name is free?",
        "answer": "Press Check on any name to see whether it's free as a company, a domain and a social media handle. In the UK, also search Companies House; in the US, search your state's business register and the USPTO trade mark search. Check your local area too, as another business nearby with a similar name can confuse clients."
      },
      {
        "question": "What are good Indian dance school names?",
        "answer": "Many Indian dance schools use a Sanskrit word linked to dance or music: natya (dance-drama), nritya (dance), laya (tempo), tala (rhythm), abhinaya (expression), mudra (hand gesture) or ghungroo (ankle bells). \"Nrityalaya\" and \"Natyalaya\" mean a home of dance. Add the style you teach (\"Laya Kathak Academy\", \"Nupura Bharatanatyam School\") so families searching for that style find you, and check the spelling with your guru or a trusted source."
      }
    ]
  }
